    "theorem": "BKThreeNormalizationAudit.actual_general_three_bk_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem actual_general_three_bk_certificate : (∀ (F L : Type) [Field F] [Fintype F] [Field L] [Algebra F L] [DecidableEq F] [DecidableEq L] [IsAlgClosed L] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F), W.Δ≠0 → Nat.Coprime 3 (Fintype.card F) → 3 ∣ Nat.card W.Point → ¬3 ∣ Fintype.card F-1 → ∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [Algebra F K] [Algebra K L] [IsScalarTower F K L] [DecidableEq K], ∀ k : ℕ, Fintype.card K=Fintype.card F^k → ((∀ P : (W.baseChange L).Point, (3:ℕ) • P=0 → P∈Set.range (pointInclusion F K L W)) ↔ 3 ∣ Fintype.card F^k-1) ∧ (Nat.card (ThreeTorsionRankAudit.General.ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange K))=9 ↔ 3 ∣ Fintype.card F^k-1)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K), W.Δ≠0 → ∀ x y : K, ∀ hN : W.Nonsingular x y, (3:ℕ) • Point.some x y hN=0 → (normalized W x y).Δ≠0 ∧ (normalized W x y).a₂=0 ∧ (normalized W x y).a₄=0 ∧ (normalized W x y).a₆=0 ∧ Nonempty ((normalized W x y).Point ≃+ W.Point)) ∧ (Nat.Prime 3 ∧ Nat.Coprime 3 7 ∧ 3 ∣ 7-1 ∧ 3^2 ∣ Nat.card TorsionBoundaryAudit.bkCurve.Point ∧ TorsionBoundaryAudit.bkCurve.Δ≠0 ∧ ∃ P : (TorsionBoundaryAudit.bkCurve.baseChange TorsionBoundaryAudit.K).Point, (3:ℕ) • P=0 ∧ FrobeniusPointDescentAudit.pointFrobenius TorsionBoundaryAudit.bkCurve P≠P) ∧ (CharP ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.OrdinaryClosure 3 ∧ ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.ordinaryBase.Δ≠0 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsionRankAudit.General.ThreeTorsion (ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.curve (1:ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.OrdinaryClosure) 1))=3 ∧ ¬((∀ P : (ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.ordinaryBase.baseChange ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.OrdinaryClosure).Point, (3:ℕ) • P=0 → P∈Set.range (pointInclusion (ZMod 3) (ZMod 3) ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.OrdinaryClosure ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.ordinaryBase)) ↔ 3 ∣ 3^1-1))",
    "decl_sha256": "6bed09a29ed54b74e475064fdd45b41cbe46f077d5ac21fe5fccc80c5b066e30",
    "scope": "Qualified Balasubramanian–Koblitz criterion at prime3 for every finitefield/every nonsingular generalWeierstrassmodel, includingchar2, every chosen extension/cardq^k/compatibleembedding. Originalcoprime(3,q),3|actualpointcard,3 notdividingq−1; actualgeometrictorsion inclusion and originalnine-point count iff3|q^k−1. No normalform/determinant/rank/pairing/abstractrationality premise. ActualCauchy point/tangentnormalization/curvegroupAddEquiv and actualscalar/tower/Frobenius transport, alln torsion/cardinality/image invariance; actualkilled3injection/bijectivecardinality bridge. CreditedF7q1/r²control and ordinarychar3Δ1/card3/deleted-coprimality inclusion-paraphrase negation, not originalninepointrefutation. Otherprimes>=5/canonicalWeil/fullallkp500/all14 gaps remainopen. No novelty/fullpaper/bookread/corpuspromotion/newnativeexperiment/spend/upload.",
